  Node:
  - sentences:
    - text: Is it true that some life forms out there actually enjoy the scent of
        recently mutilated grass? Sickos!
  - sentences:
    - text: "Have you visited Drasil\u2019s central tree yet? It\u2019s my favourite
        spot to just plant myself for an evening and relax, you should check it out."
  - sentences:
    - text: "What\u2019s it like to fly all around the galaxy? It must be so fun,
        I hope I can work for UPS one day!"
